    "detailed_description": "<h1>Developing NewGame</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023140/extras/cfabd34ed8786e6e2be8263ad335d63c.avif?t=1738896969\" /></div><br>&quot;I can't recall anything...&quot;<br><br>This is a puzzle-solving adventure game. The player leads the main character Hiber to explore the truth of the story that exists in the lost memory.<br>The game contains violence, bloody plots and pictures.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023140/extras/7ae395b1d0b71ee398f44c2c923a0fa1.avif?t=1738896969\" /></div><br><br>&quot;-- You've lost all your memories, haven't you?&quot;<br>&quot;It's just a small request.&quot;<br>&quot;I want to find -- the man who killed her.&quot;<br><br>Waking up outside the snowy capital, the dispossessed youth remembers only two things.<br>His own name, Hiber.<br>And... He must return to the Tower of Winter.<br><br>But when you enter the capital, no matter who you ask,<br>Hiber got only one answer:<br>&quot;The Tower of Winter does not exist.&quot;<br><br>&quot;You can't run away, Mr. Hiber.&quot;<br>&quot;... But can we take back those who die by accident?&quot;<br>Running away from the girls in uniform who were hunting him,<br>Ion, a young man who calls himself a magician, offers Hiber a helping hand.<br><br>... Where to go? What has he forgotten?<br>Trying to get it back, trying to get it back,<br>In the darkness, Hiber and Ion began to act together...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023140/extras/5149c39de3562eefc549f8d8cc8479c7.avif?t=1738896969\" /></div><br>Players can use Hiber's eyes to switch &quot;fields of view,&quot; interact with characters and &quot;emotions,&quot;<br> discover and use in-game clues 